OL,3,AStar Trek actor Walter Koenig, who
OL,4,Aplayed Pavel Chekov, dies aged 90
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe actor Walter Koenig, who played the
OL,7,Fspirited Russian crewman Pavel Chekov
OL,8,Fin the original Star Trek TV series,
OL,9,Fhas died aged 90, his agent confirmed.
OL,11,FThe US actor was a mainstay on the show
OL,12,Ffrom season two in 1967 until it ended
OL,13,Fin 1969, later reprising his role as
OL,14,Fthe eager and earnest Chekov, with his
OL,15,FMonkees-style mop-top haircut, in the
OL,16,Fsix original cast movies from 1979
OL,17,Fthrough 1991.
OL,19,FHe also wrote an episode for the show's
OL,20,Fanimated spin-off.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
