OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the mid-late 1990s, Koenig portrayed
OL,7,Fa very different character, the
OL,8,Fruthless Psi Corps telepath Alfred
OL,9,FBester, in another sci-fi space series,
OL,10,FBabylon 5.
